/* P005: MANIFOLD_SOLID_BREP with a single ADVANCED_FACE over SPHERICAL_SURFACE whose FACE_OUTER_BOUND has orientation .F. (inverted); face normal points inward — inside-out sphere face; sweep-orientation bug from FreeCAD Part workbench; OCCT heals the orientation and loads shape(1) */
